msgid ""
"# Gesture Navigation\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar supports touch gestures on the map:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Swipe Up** (U): Zoom in\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Swipe Down** (D): Zoom out\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Swipe Right** (R): Previous screen mode\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Swipe Left** (L): Next screen mode\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Up-Down** (UD): Auto zoom\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Down-Up** (DU): Menu\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Down-Right** (DR): Waypoint details\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Down-Left** (DL): Alternates\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Left-Up** (LU): Recently used waypoints\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Right-Down** (RD): Task manager\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Up-Right-Down** (URD): Analysis\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Left-Down-Right** (LDR): Checklist\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Up-Right-Down-Left** (URDL): Pan mode\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Left-Down-Right-Down-Left** (LDRDL): Status\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Up-Left-Down-Right** (ULDR): Quick menu\n"
"\n"
"Long-press on the map to enter Pan mode. Tap while in Pan mode to see nearby waypoints."
msgstr ""
"# Gebaarnavigatie\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar ondersteunt touchgebaren op de kaart:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Veeg omhoog** (U): Inzoomen\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Veeg omlaag** (D): Uitzoomen\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Veeg rechts** (R): Vorige schermmodus\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Veeg links** (L): Volgende schermmodus\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Omhoog-Omlaag** (UD): Autozoom\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Omlaag-Omhoog** (DU): Menu\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Omlaag-Rechts** (DR): Waypointdetails\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Omlaag-Links** (DL): Uitwijken\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Links-Omhoog** (LU): Recent gebruikte waypoints\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Rechts-Omlaag** (RD): Taakbeheer\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Omhoog-Rechts-Omlaag** (URD): Analyse\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Links-Omlaag-Rechts** (LDR): Checklist\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Omhoog-Rechts-Omlaag-Links** (URDL): Pan-modus\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Links-Omlaag-Rechts-Omlaag-Links** (LDRDL): Status\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Omhoog-Links-Omlaag-Rechts** (ULDR): Snelmenu\n"
"\n"
"Lang indrukken op de kaart om Pan-modus te starten. Tik in Pan-modus om nabije waypoints te zien."

msgid "Please enter four letters or digits only (ICAO station code)."
msgstr "Voer alleen vier letters of cijfers in (ICAO-stationscode)."

